00:02:09.565 --> 00:02:10.420
- Uh, I'm not ready.

00:02:10.420 --> 00:02:11.253
(laughing)

00:02:11.253 --> 00:02:15.420
- [Woman] You said two minutes. (laughs)

00:02:16.427 --> 00:02:17.546
- [Will] Alright, umm.

00:02:17.546 --> 00:02:20.424
- [Woman] Are you getting it?

00:02:20.424 --> 00:02:21.902
Maybe you pretend to be.

00:02:21.902 --> 00:02:23.688
- No, no, I got it, it
just takes a minute.

00:02:23.688 --> 00:02:24.780
It just takes a minute.

00:02:24.780 --> 00:02:25.613
- [Woman] Yeah.

00:02:25.613 --> 00:02:26.446
- [Man] No, it's fine, it's fine.

00:02:26.446 --> 00:02:27.499
- [Woman] That's the whole problem with

00:02:27.499 --> 00:02:30.482
the Rubik's Cube.
- No, it's fine, it's fine.

00:02:30.482 --> 00:02:33.232
(Will muttering)

00:02:38.701 --> 00:02:41.237
- Oh!
- Whoa, whoa, whoa!

00:02:41.237 --> 00:02:42.070
- [Man] Oh.

00:02:42.070 --> 00:02:43.594
- [Woman] Whoa, we've got something there.

00:02:43.594 --> 00:02:44.995
Man!
- Almost.

00:02:44.995 --> 00:02:46.579
(audience exclaiming)

00:02:46.579 --> 00:02:47.672
- Yes!
- Whoa!

00:02:47.672 --> 00:02:51.061
(audience cheering)

00:02:51.061 --> 00:02:53.728
(Will laughing)

00:02:57.168 --> 00:02:58.911
- There you go, you kids
were runnin' for real,

00:02:58.911 --> 00:03:00.521
I had you runnin' for real.

00:03:00.521 --> 00:03:01.632
(ding)

00:03:01.632 --> 00:03:03.243
- Fact number three, he's part owner

00:03:03.243 --> 00:03:06.534
of the Philadelphia 76ers basketball team.

00:03:06.534 --> 00:03:09.297
- There is nothing like,
in all of entertainment,

00:03:09.297 --> 00:03:11.797
