00:03:16.725 --> 00:03:17.932
- I can't even imagine.
- Like,

00:03:17.932 --> 00:03:19.347
that is ridiculous.

00:03:19.347 --> 00:03:21.768
I mean, if the team
doesn't win it sucks later.

00:03:21.768 --> 00:03:23.055
- Yeah, right, right. (laughs)
- Right.

00:03:23.055 --> 00:03:23.913
(audience laughing)

00:03:23.913 --> 00:03:26.409
- But at first initial,
it's like fantastic.

00:03:26.409 --> 00:03:28.326
It's like, yeah Will!
(Jonathan laughing)

00:03:28.326 --> 00:03:29.461
(ding)

00:03:29.461 --> 00:03:30.314
Fact number four,

00:03:30.314 --> 00:03:31.714
he was the first hip hop artist

00:03:31.714 --> 00:03:34.197
to be nominated for an Academy Award.

00:03:34.197 --> 00:03:35.238
(audience laughing)

00:03:35.238 --> 00:03:36.211
- And were you nominated for

00:03:36.211 --> 00:03:37.072
an Academy Award?
- Nominated for an Oscar, yep.

00:03:37.072 --> 00:03:37.935
- [Jonathan] What a great moment.

00:03:37.935 --> 00:03:38.768
- Best Actor.

00:03:38.768 --> 00:03:39.853
- I read somewhere that you can't,

00:03:39.853 --> 00:03:41.798
'cause you lost it to Denzel
Washington, didn't you?

00:03:41.798 --> 00:03:43.902
- Well now, you don't
lose, see, you just...

00:03:43.902 --> 00:03:44.843
- Well, you didn't win it, did you?

00:03:44.843 --> 00:03:47.544
