00:03:47.544 --> 00:03:49.487
- You can pretty it up
however you want Will.

00:03:49.487 --> 00:03:50.320
- Okay.

00:03:50.320 --> 00:03:51.311
- Unless you take it all
- You don't lose

00:03:51.311 --> 00:03:52.144
- You didn't win it.

00:03:52.144 --> 00:03:53.984
- You don't lose an Oscar once you're,

00:03:53.984 --> 00:03:57.212
I'm still the Academy Award nominee,

00:03:57.212 --> 00:03:58.201
- Yes.
- Will Smith.

00:03:58.201 --> 00:03:59.191
We're all winners.
- Yes.

00:03:59.191 --> 00:04:01.490
No, no, no you're not.
(audience laughing)

00:04:01.490 --> 00:04:03.425
- That's what they say at the Oscar lunch!

00:04:03.425 --> 00:04:06.672
It says it over, it says,
you're all already winners.

00:04:06.672 --> 00:04:08.389
- Okay, that's good.
- You weren't there Jonathan!

00:04:08.389 --> 00:04:10.391
(audience laughs)
- No.

00:04:10.391 --> 00:04:11.711
So Will, which of your

00:04:11.711 --> 00:04:13.154
