Which one was that for?

00:04:18.954 --> 00:04:20.256
- It was Training Day.

00:04:20.256 --> 00:04:21.089
- Great film.

00:04:21.089 --> 00:04:22.783
- Yes, no, fantastic film.
- First of all, great film.

00:04:22.783 --> 00:04:23.861
But I read somewhere that you weren't,

00:04:23.861 --> 00:04:25.991
you kind of, I don't know whether you said

00:04:25.991 --> 00:04:27.154
you didn't feel ready, or same time,

00:04:27.154 --> 00:04:29.828
