00:04:31.684 --> 00:04:33.568
you get invited to the party, it's huge.

00:04:33.568 --> 00:04:34.764
- Yeah, big time.
- Ya know.

00:04:34.764 --> 00:04:38.592
I can always tell when things aren't right

00:04:38.592 --> 00:04:40.168
