(audience laughing)

00:04:49.434 --> 00:04:50.862
- I was like, hey it's my time!

00:04:50.862 --> 00:04:52.514
Wait, hold on, that
other boy took my thing.

00:04:52.514 --> 00:04:53.957
(Jonathan laughing)
(audience laughing)

00:04:53.957 --> 00:04:55.875
- He didn't win it, though.

00:04:55.875 --> 00:04:58.190
- Well, we were all
winners once we got there.

00:04:58.190 --> 00:05:01.287
- You're a double-winner!
(Will laughing)

00:05:01.287 --> 00:05:02.557
- You just don't have one yet.

00:05:02.557 --> 00:05:03.562
- You know, but I'm telling you,

00:05:03.562 --> 00:05:04.492
it really is one of those awards,

00:05:04.492 --> 00:05:06.771
it's so, it's like the show is so huge,

00:05:06.771 --> 00:05:08.857
the concept of it is so huge,

00:05:08.857 --> 00:05:12.256
it's wonderful to be
invited to the big dance.

00:05:12.256 --> 00:05:13.089
(ding)

00:05:13.089 --> 00:05:13.922
- Fact number five,

00:05:13.922 --> 00:05:15.226
he first met his wife-to-be,

00:05:15.226 --> 00:05:16.950
Jada Pinkett Smith, when she auditioned

00:05:16.950 --> 00:05:20.700
to be his girlfriend on The
Fresh Prince of Bel Air.

00:05:20.700 --> 00:05:23.515
- You mentioned Will, who
everybody knows who Will Smith is,

00:05:23.515 --> 00:05:26.922
but I heard you auditioned
for Fresh Prince, too.

00:05:26.922 --> 00:05:27.766
- I did.

00:05:27.766 --> 00:05:29.138
(audience laughing)

00:05:29.138 --> 00:05:30.036
- As his girlfriend.
- I did.

00:05:30.036 --> 00:05:31.734
I auditioned as his girlfriend.

00:05:31.734 --> 00:05:33.495
I'll never forget.

00:05:33.495 --> 00:05:38.194
(host laughing)
(audience laughing)

00:05:38.194 --> 00:05:39.584
You know, he was, it's funny

00:05:39.584 --> 00:05:40.983
