were comin' up in there.

00:05:49.493 --> 00:05:50.469
You know what I'm sayin'?

00:05:50.469 --> 00:05:53.215
So he's sittin' out in the hallway.

00:05:53.215 --> 00:05:54.518
(host laughing)

00:05:54.518 --> 00:05:57.994
So I walk in and, you
know the casting director,

00:05:57.994 --> 00:05:59.886
