00:06:07.955 --> 00:06:10.910
And I was like, oh alright.

00:06:10.910 --> 00:06:13.862
(host laughing)
(audience laughing)

00:06:13.862 --> 00:06:15.611
Alright, cool.

00:06:15.611 --> 00:06:17.169
