00:06:20.099 --> 00:06:21.867
(host laughing)
(audience laughing)

00:06:21.867 --> 00:06:23.900
Ain't nothin' for us to talk about, homie.

00:06:23.900 --> 00:06:26.400
She already said you ain't got

00:06:27.851 --> 00:06:29.761
