00:06:29.761 --> 00:06:31.388
(host laughing)
(audience laughing)

00:06:31.388 --> 00:06:34.305
And then, over the years, you know,

00:06:35.396 --> 00:06:37.275
I did A Different World,

00:06:37.275 --> 00:06:38.822
and then I did a couple movies,

00:06:38.822 --> 00:06:40.572
and then he want to come, you know,

00:06:40.572 --> 00:06:43.239
