regular on Fresh Prince?

00:06:56.185 --> 00:06:57.716
And at that time, I was like,

00:06:57.716 --> 00:06:59.722
I'm not tryin' to do television right now.

00:06:59.722 --> 00:07:00.611
(host laughing)

00:07:00.611 --> 00:07:01.913
