00:09:34.011 --> 00:09:34.844
- (speaks Spanish)

00:09:34.844 --> 00:09:36.251
- (speaks Spanish) (laughs)

00:09:36.251 --> 00:09:37.084
- (speaks Spanish)

00:09:37.084 --> 00:09:38.208
- (speaks Spanish)

00:09:38.208 --> 00:09:39.431
(ding)

00:09:39.431 --> 00:09:40.602
